{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos of Destiny Remake</strong> is a <strong>turn-based RPG</strong> with a <strong>dark atmosphere</strong> where you must face the <strong>tyrannical Prisma Team</strong> and <strong>monsters born from the darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>cities, villages, and dungeons</strong>, <strong>craft items</strong> through <strong>alchemy recipes</strong>, and <strong>uncover secrets</strong> hidden after the <strong>fall of the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a story filled with <strong>peculiar characters</strong>, <strong>formidable enemies</strong>, and a <strong>protagonist</strong> marked by a <strong>past</strong> the game itself tries to <strong>conceal</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Classic turn-based combat</strong> with <strong>skills, magic, and strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Recipe and alchemy system</strong> to make use of <strong>hundreds of items</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Exploration of a world in chaos</strong>, with <strong>cities protected by walls</strong> and <strong>places corrupted by darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Unique characters</strong> like <strong>Catty</strong> or <strong>Kortana</strong>, who will surely make your <strong>experience memorable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f More than <strong>800 items</strong>, <strong>secrets</strong>, and <strong>fourth-wall-breaking events</strong> that are part of the <strong>experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 A <strong>varied soundtrack</strong> with music from <strong>different composers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Your choices</strong> will <strong>shape the story</strong>, affecting <strong>relationships with characters</strong>, <strong>events</strong>, and <strong>potential paths</strong>. <strong>Every decision</strong> can lead to <strong>unexpected consequences</strong>, making <strong>each playthrough</strong> a <strong>unique experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chaos of Destiny is designed to play with you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It\u2019s not a glitch. It\u2019s the game protecting itself from you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Monsters don\u2019t always attack. Sometimes they just watch.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Survive. But don\u2019t trust reality.&quot;</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230030?t=1761558002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761558002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230030/cea1f79e18d29be689bbf7b7cd79da043bc28af7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761558002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230030/cea1f79e18d29be689bbf7b7cd79da043bc28af7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761558002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Dark and Emotional Themes\r\n\r\nPsychological Complexity\r\n\r\nMeta Elements and Intense Glitches\r\n\r\nDark Humor and Unpredictable Tone\r\n\r\nPotentially Disturbing Content\r\n\r\nChaos of Destiny features intense narrative elements, emotionally complex themes, and moments that may be disturbing or sensitive for some players. While it does not include extreme graphic violence or sexual content, the moral weight of decisions, dark atmosphere, and impactful events make it more suitable for adult or young adult audiences who appreciate deep storytelling."},"demos":[{"appid":3535300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Purchase Offer!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey is about to begin! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos of Destiny Remake is coming to <strong>Early Access</strong>, and we want to invite you to be a part of this adventure from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Why join now?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in the development by providing your feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be among the first to experience new mechanics, items, and never-before-seen content from the remake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the best part! <strong>If you purchase during Early Access, you'll get a 20% discount off the final price.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 This offer is only available during the Early Access phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Join the community, share your ideas, and help shape the future of Chaos of Destiny Remake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face Team Prism, discover the hidden secrets of this world, and defy the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Get your early copy today and save 20%.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos of Destiny Remake</strong> is a <strong>turn-based RPG</strong> with a <strong>dark atmosphere</strong> where you must face the <strong>tyrannical Prisma Team</strong> and <strong>monsters born from the darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>cities, villages, and dungeons</strong>, <strong>craft items</strong> through <strong>alchemy recipes</strong>, and <strong>uncover secrets</strong> hidden after the <strong>fall of the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a story filled with <strong>peculiar characters</strong>, <strong>formidable enemies</strong>, and a <strong>protagonist</strong> marked by a <strong>past</strong> the game itself tries to <strong>conceal</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Classic turn-based combat</strong> with <strong>skills, magic, and strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Recipe and alchemy system</strong> to make use of <strong>hundreds of items</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Exploration of a world in chaos</strong>, with <strong>cities protected by walls</strong> and <strong>places corrupted by darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Unique characters</strong> like <strong>Catty</strong> or <strong>Kortana</strong>, who will surely make your <strong>experience memorable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f More than <strong>800 items</strong>, <strong>secrets</strong>, and <strong>fourth-wall-breaking events</strong> that are part of the <strong>experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 A <strong>varied soundtrack</strong> with music from <strong>different composers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Your choices</strong> will <strong>shape the story</strong>, affecting <strong>relationships with characters</strong>, <strong>events</strong>, and <strong>potential paths</strong>. <strong>Every decision</strong> can lead to <strong>unexpected consequences</strong>, making <strong>each playthrough</strong> a <strong>unique experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chaos of Destiny is designed to play with you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragr